      "marks": 1,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "explanation": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "value": "$12 + 4x - x^2 = 16 - (x - 2)^2$. Maximum of quadratic argument is 16 at $x = 2$. Maximum of $\\log_2(16) = 4$."
